                            The .NET Ecosystem
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            If C# is the language, .NET is the entire toolset and
                            workshop where you use that language. .NET provides the
                            environment, tools, and libraries required to build and
                            run C# applications.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Over the years, .NET has evolved.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            <strong>Old Way (.NET Framework):</strong>
                            It was primarily designed to work on Windows computers.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            <strong>Modern Way (.NET Core / Modern .NET):</strong>
                            Modern .NET is cross-platform and works on Windows,
                            macOS, and Linux.
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            When you install the .NET platform, you work with several
                            important components.
                        </p>


