                                </div>

                            </div>


                            <div class="col-md-6">

                                <div class="card h-100 border">

                                    <div class="card-body">

                                        <h5 class="fw-bold">
                                            JIT Compilation
                                        </h5>

                                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                                            The JIT compiler converts Intermediate Language
                                            into machine code when the application runs.
                                        </p>

                                    </div>

                                </div>

                            </div>


                            <div class="col-md-6">

                                <div class="card h-100 border">

                                    <div class="card-body">

